        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/dbc845/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-12-25T05:11:52.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Sorry but I could not find a ruling for my question so here it is:</p><p>Wraith's and Tachyon's cards which are Throat Jab and Hypersonic Assault deals each non-hero target 1 damage and then they cannot deal damage until the start of their turn.&nbsp;</p><p>If the target's were immune to the damage or it was reduced to 0, would they still be able to deal damage?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:39:53.885Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
