      {
        "id": 85405,
        "name": "Envisioner",
        "username": "Envisioner",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/9de053/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-12-25T05:43:26.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>In most cases, probably for balance reasons, effects which entirely stop damage from being dealt are contingent on damage getting through (Throat Jab), while effects that simply reduce the damage by 1 are not (Stun Bolt).&nbsp; Note also that multiple Stun Bolts are cumulative, and that Stun Bolt in particular is not Limited like most of Wraith's Equipment (also not limited is Infrared Eyepiece; both of these can be doubled-up-on with a Utility Belt).</p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:09:04.673Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
