        "id": 85410,
        "name": "danmarshall14",
        "username": "danmarshall14",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/danmarshall14/{size}/1944_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-12-31T18:21:37.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>This is in the same camp as Nightmist not being able to redirect damage while in Mist Form.&nbsp; Since she is immune to damage, she cannot redirect it since she wouldn't be taking damage.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Though, in the end, some card texts will let you work around this rule (like Stun Bolt, as mentioned above).&nbsp; Wording is key here.</p>",
